6-sample compensation and per-utterance cache reset, but no runtime state or memory was measured; the native screen measured a different 512-sample lag.","id":"ENH-05","requirement":"Report alignment, state and memory.","status":"blocked"},{"evidence":"No device clock, pacing, deadline, throughput or availability measurement was made; historical batch RTF is not a local measurement.","id":"ENH-06","requirement":"Report measured content/availability timing for the exact runtime.","status":"blocked"}],"state_reported":false,"status":"blocked","task_matched_baseline":false,"unpaired_predictive_screen":false},"evidence_status":"incomplete","exact_blockers":[{"artifact_id":"ART-01","id":"BLK-01","linked_gates":["RG-01","RG-04"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Supply the exact caller-held 16 kHz Small ONNX graph bytes at the pinned byte count and SHA-256 from the pinned release, verified without a network download.","statement":"The exact 16 kHz Small ONNX release graph is absent. data/models/fastenhancer/fastenhancer_s.onnx does not exist. The external ledger pins 832,813 bytes and SHA-256 d7c937d6b475dbe89a6e6a69853b685fe62d629f4c96077559c556ac6f8aaa2d at release commit 49ab55a57e3a064d94c6412cd0f0a383a55ca0f8 / onnx-dns-v1.0.0. A different local export at cpp-library/.deps/fastenhancer_s.onnx is 875,885 bytes, SHA-256 f04ece2beed330da367264c54cedded62f65a117fbde5c005d3a88fc796d0ba3 and declares wav_in [1,512], consistent with the 48 kHz 512-sample-chunk variant. It is not the pinned 16 kHz artifact, no equivalence is proven and it is not admitted.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-02","id":"BLK-02","linked_gates":["RG-02","RG-07"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Install the exact CPython 3.10 / onnxruntime 1.20.1 / numpy 1.26.4 / soundfile 0.13.1 environment from the hash-pinned lock in an approved isolated runner and record every artifact digest.","statement":"The pinned Python inference runtime is absent. onnxruntime is not importable in the evidence interpreter, no CPython 3.10 environment with onnxruntime 1.20.1 (wheel SHA-256 e50ba5ff7fed4f7d9253a6baf801ca2883cc08491f9d32d78a80da57256a5439) exists at any fixed probe path, and the hash-pinned requirements.lock is not installed. A local C++ onnxruntime 1.31.1 prebuilt tree exists at cpp-library/.deps/onnxruntime-osx-arm64-1.31.1 but it is not the pinned Python runtime, was not imported, loaded or executed, and is not admitted.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-03","id":"BLK-03","linked_gates":["RG-03"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Supply written model-weight, training-data and runtime terms plus the complete notice bundle and an explicit legal/redistribution decision for the exact graph and runtime.","statement":"The upstream repository is MIT-licensed, but the release page does not state separate pretrained-model terms; the ledger records 'not specified separately; retain local only'. Exact training-data provenance, third-party notices and a redistribution/product-use decision for the ONNX graph and runtime are not established.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-04","id":"BLK-04","linked_gates":["RG-04","RG-06"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Produce approved reference outputs on frozen inputs with the pinned graph and runtime and record exact output digests, finiteness, peaks, length, state reset and source mapping.","statement":"No approved exact reference output, frozen input vector or pinned output digest exists, and no candidate output was produced. The documented 256-sample chunk / 512-point FFT / 256-sample compensation boundary was not exercised. Historical research outputs were not reproduced here.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-05","id":"BLK-05","linked_gates":["RG-05","RG-06"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Supply a rights-cleared paired cohort with clean references, a pinned independent scorer and an approved listening protocol, then report all controls and adverse cases.","statement":"No rights-cleared paired real-s